```Query 1: Detect Brute Force Login
EventCode 4625 records each failed login. 5 or more failures from the same IP within a brief period suggests a brute force attack.```
index=security EventCode=4625
| bin _time span=5m
| stats count AS failed_logins BY _time src_ip user
| where failed_logins >= 5
| sort - failed_logins
| table _time src_ip user failed_logins
